---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Andrea Turco, Product Digital Designer di Roma. Head of Design presso Fabaris (S3K group) dal 2012. Vent'anni di progetti enterprise, PA e industria."
>
  <section class="about-page">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="ap-header">
        <p class="mono section-label">About</p>
        <h1 class="ap-title display">Sono Andrea Turco.</h1>
      </header>

      <div class="ap-body">
        <div class="ap-photo">
          <img src="/andrea-photo-bw.jpg" alt="Andrea Turco" />
        </div>

        <div class="ap-text">
          <p class="ap-lead">
            Product Digital Designer di Roma. Head of Design presso Fabaris (S3K group) dal 2012.
            Progetto prodotti digitali da oltre vent'anni.
          </p>

          <p>
            Ho lavorato in diversi settori — dalla pubblica amministrazione all'industria,
            dal luxury al gaming. Tra i clienti: Ministero della Difesa, MBDA, NATO, Microsoft,
            Ford, Range Rover, Ferragamo, Sisal, Alitalia, ABB, Würth.
          </p>

          <p>
            Ho esperienza in product design, design system, accessibilità (WCAG, AGID, EAA),
            leadership di team in ambienti Agile. Mi focalizzo sul prodotto, non sulla letteratura.
          </p>

          <div class="ap-meta">
            <div class="ap-meta-block">
              <h3 class="mono ap-meta-label">Expertise</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Product Design</li>
                <li>Design System</li>
                <li>Accessibilità (WCAG, AGID, EAA)</li>
                <li>Research &amp; Co-design</li>
                <li>Design Leadership</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="ap-meta-block">
              <h3 class="mono ap-meta-label">Tools</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Figma</li>
                <li>Adobe CC</li>
                <li>HTML, CSS, JavaScript</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="ap-meta-block">
              <h3 class="mono ap-meta-label">Certificazioni</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Scrum PSM I (Scrum.org)</li>
                <li>Master Product Management (Product Heroes)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="ap-meta-block">
              <h3 class="mono ap-meta-label">Lingue</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Italiano (madrelingua)</li>
                <li>English (professional)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="ap-cta">
            <a href="/cv-andrea-turco.pdf" download class="ap-cv-link">Scarica il CV →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page { padding: 80px 0 120px; }
  .ap-header { margin-bottom: 64px; }
  .section-label { color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .ap-title { font-size: clamp(56px, 10vw, 128px); }

  .ap-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .ap-photo {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .ap-photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(1.02); }

  .ap-lead {
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .ap-text p { color: var(--text); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px; max-width: 640px; }

  .ap-meta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 40px;
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding-top: 48px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .ap-meta-label { color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .ap-meta-block ul { list-style: none; }
  .ap-meta-block li { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 6px; }

  .ap-cta { margin-top: 48px; }
  .ap-cv-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--text);
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    transition: color var(--transition), border-color var(--transition);
  }
  .ap-cv-link:hover { color: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .ap-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    .ap-photo { max-width: 240px; }
    .ap-meta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
  }
</style>
